development.question_text:
The graph of $y = f(x)$ shows exponential decay, strictly decreasing for all $x$ and approaching the horizontal asymptote $y = 0$ as $x \to \infty$.

[tikz]\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[->] (-2.5,0) -- (3.5,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[->] (0,-1) -- (0,3.5) node[above] {$y$};
